ops/reviews/phan-bien-quy-trinh-review-1-claude-verdict.receipt.yaml:23 .assurance_ghi_chu HA TU `same_provider_approved` theo finding F3 cua cross-review PR #455 (codex, head 663da64). Ly do do duoc, va no nam ngay trong chinh khoi identity moi them: luot nay chay bang SUBAGENT TRONG cung phien dieu phoi — khong phien rieng, khong worktree rieng, khong `run_id`, khong bam prompt. `PROTOCOL §8` doi same-provider CUNG phai la mot phien MOI voi context/worktree rieng, nen thieu bang chung doc lap KHONG tro thanh mot muc approval. Ban truoc lay chinh cau "tinh doc lap KHONG DO DUOC" de bien minh cho muc approval — do la loi khai RONG HON phep do. `review_deferred` KHONG co nghia "chua tung review": verdict CO THAT va con nguyen byte; thu thieu la THAM QUYEN, khong phai lo trinh. Chi phuc hoi muc approval neu tim duoc bang chung doc lap KIEM DUOC — khong bia `run_id` hay bam prompt hoi to.
