ops/reviews/wp538-review-1-claude-verdict.receipt.yaml:155 .anchor.gioi_han `cuong_do: thap` vi mo neo hien CHI la mot nhanh, khong phai tag `luu-tru/*` va khong phai to tien cua `master`. Nhanh xoa duoc va SHA se thanh khong tra duoc. Manh len `cao` khi WP538 land bang merge commit hoac fast-forward; squash pha quan he to tien.
